  "result": "The two decisions sit in three files.\n\n- **Which organizations are due:** `shouldRunForOrg` in `src/server/jobs/digest-email-job.ts` decides this. An org qualifies only if it isn't archived and the current UTC hour equals its `digestHourUtc`. `runDigestEmailJob` calls it on each tick. The cron route `src/app/api/cron/digest/route.ts` only triggers the job.\n- **Who is on the list inside an org:** `listDigestRecipients` in `src/server/services/digest-service.ts` decides this. It delegates to `listDigestSubscribers` in `src/server/repositories/notification-preference-repository.ts`. That query returns the distinct users with at least one `digestOnly` preference in the org.\n\nANSWER: src/server/jobs/digest-email-job.ts, src/server/services/digest-service.ts, src/server/repositories/notification-preference-repository.ts",
